{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L118","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:118"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfields","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFields"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFields"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FieldGroupFields"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfieldcomponents","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFieldComponents"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFieldComponents"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ReactComponentTree.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReactComponentTree"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"bindcomponent","children":[{"type":"text","value":"bindComponent"}]},{"type":"code","value":"bindComponent: FieldGroupWithFieldsFn<ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L191","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:191"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Binds a component's field-group API prop to concrete paths in a parent\nform."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The returned component accepts the original component props except for the\ninjected field-group API prop and adds a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"form"},{"type":"text","value":" prop. When every virtual\nfield name is already a compatible form path, those paths bind\nautomatically when the bindings prop is omitted. A complete bindings map\ncan still reroute them. Otherwise, the injected prop name is reused for the\nrequired virtual-to-concrete field binding map."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const passwordFieldGroup = defineFieldGroup(({ strict }) => ({\n  password: strict<string>(),\n  confirmPassword: strict<string>(),\n}))\n\ninterface PasswordFieldsProps {\n  fields: typeof passwordFieldGroup.fields\n  legend: string\n}\n\nfunction PasswordFields({ fields, legend }: PasswordFieldsProps) {\n  return (\n    <fieldset>\n      <legend>{legend}</legend>\n      <fields.Field name=\"password\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n      <fields.Field name=\"confirmPassword\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n    </fieldset>\n  )\n}\n\nconst PasswordSection = passwordFieldGroup.bindComponent(\n  PasswordFields,\n  'fields',\n)\n\n<PasswordSection\n  form={form}\n  legend=\"Choose a password\"\n  fields={{\n    password: 'account.password',\n    confirmPassword: 'account.confirmPassword',\n  }}\n/>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"fields","children":[{"type":"text","value":"fields"}]},{"type":"code","value":"fields: ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L126","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:126"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The virtual field-group API injected into the component passed to\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"bindComponent"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfields","text":"TFields","level":3},{"id":"tfieldcomponents","text":"TFieldComponents","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"bindcomponent","text":"bindComponent","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"fields","text":"fields","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:118](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L118)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFields\n\n`TFields` *extends* `FieldGroupFields`\n\n### TFieldComponents\n\n`TFieldComponents` *extends* [`ReactComponentTree`](../type-aliases/ReactComponentTree.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### bindComponent\n\n```ts\nbindComponent: FieldGroupWithFieldsFn<ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L191)\n\nBinds a component's field-group API prop to concrete paths in a parent\nform.\n\nThe returned component accepts the original component props except for the\ninjected field-group API prop and adds a `form` prop. When every virtual\nfield name is already a compatible form path, those paths bind\nautomatically when the bindings prop is omitted. A complete bindings map\ncan still reroute them. Otherwise, the injected prop name is reused for the\nrequired virtual-to-concrete field binding map.\n\n#### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst passwordFieldGroup = defineFieldGroup(({ strict }) => ({\n  password: strict<string>(),\n  confirmPassword: strict<string>(),\n}))\n\ninterface PasswordFieldsProps {\n  fields: typeof passwordFieldGroup.fields\n  legend: string\n}\n\nfunction PasswordFields({ fields, legend }: PasswordFieldsProps) {\n  return (\n    <fieldset>\n      <legend>{legend}</legend>\n      <fields.Field name=\"password\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n      <fields.Field name=\"confirmPassword\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n    </fieldset>\n  )\n}\n\nconst PasswordSection = passwordFieldGroup.bindComponent(\n  PasswordFields,\n  'fields',\n)\n\n<PasswordSection\n  form={form}\n  legend=\"Choose a password\"\n  fields={{\n    password: 'account.password',\n    confirmPassword: 'account.confirmPassword',\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n***\n\n### fields\n\n```ts\nfields: ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L126)\n\nThe virtual field-group API injected into the component passed to\n`bindComponent`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FieldGroupDefinition\ntitle: FieldGroupDefinition\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:118](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L118)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFields\n\n`TFields` *extends* `FieldGroupFields`\n\n### TFieldComponents\n\n`TFieldComponents` *extends* [`ReactComponentTree`](../type-aliases/ReactComponentTree.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### bindComponent\n\n```ts\nbindComponent: FieldGroupWithFieldsFn<ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L191)\n\nBinds a component's field-group API prop to concrete paths in a parent\nform.\n\nThe returned component accepts the original component props except for the\ninjected field-group API prop and adds a `form` prop. When every virtual\nfield name is already a compatible form path, those paths bind\nautomatically when the bindings prop is omitted. A complete bindings map\ncan still reroute them. Otherwise, the injected prop name is reused for the\nrequired virtual-to-concrete field binding map.\n\n#### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst passwordFieldGroup = defineFieldGroup(({ strict }) => ({\n  password: strict<string>(),\n  confirmPassword: strict<string>(),\n}))\n\ninterface PasswordFieldsProps {\n  fields: typeof passwordFieldGroup.fields\n  legend: string\n}\n\nfunction PasswordFields({ fields, legend }: PasswordFieldsProps) {\n  return (\n    <fieldset>\n      <legend>{legend}</legend>\n      <fields.Field name=\"password\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n      <fields.Field name=\"confirmPassword\">\n        {(field) => (\n          <input\n            type=\"password\"\n            value={field.value}\n            onChange={(event) => field.handleChange(event.target.value)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </fields.Field>\n    </fieldset>\n  )\n}\n\nconst PasswordSection = passwordFieldGroup.bindComponent(\n  PasswordFields,\n  'fields',\n)\n\n<PasswordSection\n  form={form}\n  legend=\"Choose a password\"\n  fields={{\n    password: 'account.password',\n    confirmPassword: 'account.confirmPassword',\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n***\n\n### fields\n\n```ts\nfields: ReactFieldGroup<TFields, TFieldComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/FieldGroup/withFields.public.ts#L126)\n\nThe virtual field-group API injected into the component passed to\n`bindComponent`.\n"}
